\b programa\'e7\'e3o - modelar percep\'e7\'e3o e ac\'e7\'e3o
\b0 \

\i Programming involves constant movement\
between writing instructions and executing them with a user in the loop.\
The testing process reveals dynamics that emerge through interaction\
that can only be partly anticipated. These interactions reveal emergent\
topological 
\b dynamics of the entire computer / user system.
\b0 \
Many new media art works, and most computer games, arrange these\
formal elements in complex ways to overlap with and intensify existing\
cultural relationships, 
\b extend fields of perception and action
\b0 , and\
reframe ritualised forms of activity.
